      },
      "statement": "Construct genuine common R/S and for each y fix original D_y before epsilon/f. Produce ONE actual u in the SAME original D.closure.domain for every positive epsilon and forcing, all-domain variational identity, local-volume L1 of u/G, ALL C1 compact ordinary weak-gradient products/identity, local squared PDE residual and compact-volume L2, ALL C2 compact ordinary weak-Poisson products/identity, and ALL C2 compact chi actual v/Gchi/Fchi volumeL2/support/weak identities. Derive exact ((alpha+eta^-1)/4)*norm(D_y.closureu)^2<=norm(f-epsilon*u)^2<=normf^2 from true reflected lower/upper curvature. No joint measurable fiber choice or complete Poincare/BL/main result is inferred.",
      "assumptions": [
        "Finite real Hilbert/Borel E including0; V C2, NNReal alpha/beta with 0<alpha<=beta and actual all-point/all-vector alpha I<=HessV<=beta I. eta>0 and beta*eta<=1 are retained.",
        "Actual Gaussian augmentation J=(x,x+sqrteta*xi)#(mu*standardGaussian) and common genuine Markov/disintegrating R/S with S_y=(2x-y)#R_y and S_y=volume.tilted(-W_y), W_y(z)=V((y+z)/2)+norm(z-y)^2/(8eta). Source C2 W_y, integrability/positive partition and original dense closable exact compact-smooth D_y with closed closure are produced. Only explicit W_y Hessian facts are extracted from the accepted curvature parent; its auxiliary R2/S2 are not equated with the resolvent kernels."
      ],
      "formulae": [
        {
          "label": "Actual PBPS reflected global quarter-scale coercivity",
          "tex": "\\exists R,S\\ \\forall y\\ \\exists D_y\\ \\forall\\varepsilon>0,f\\ \\exists u:\\quad\\frac{\\alpha+\\eta^{-1}}4\\|\\overline D_yu\\|_{S_y}^2\\le\\|f-\\varepsilon u\\|_{S_y}^2\\le\\|f\\|_{S_y}^2."
        }
      ],
